@*
    Intentionally empty.

    jQuery Validation and its unobtrusive adapter are now loaded once for every page in
    _Layout.cshtml, so every form validates client-side instead of only the pages that
    remembered to render this partial.

    This partial is kept as a no-op so the existing
    RenderPartialAsync("_ValidationScriptsPartial") calls across the views keep working
    without loading the scripts twice — a double-loaded unobtrusive adapter can bind
    duplicate validation messages to the same field.
*@
